"a rii: {}).\n\n<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Ṣiṣayẹwo ohun elo TPM ati awọn irinṣẹ.."
"."

#: src/onboarding.py:466
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi {} rẹ nipa lilo ijẹrisi oju (apamọwọ ti "
"a rii: {}).\n\n<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Awari ohun elo TPM. Fifi <i>tpm2-tools<"
"/i> sori ẹrọ laifọwọyi..."

#: src/onboarding.py:478
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi {} rẹ nipa lilo ijẹrisi oju (apamọwọ ti "
"a rii: {}).\n\n<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 nṣiṣẹ. Ọrọigbaniwọle r"
"ẹ yoo wa ni ifipamo ni aabo inu TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:480
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi {} rẹ nipa lilo ijẹrisi oju (apamọwọ ti "
"a rii: {}).\n\n<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Ti ṣe awari ohun elo TPM, ṣugbọn fifi s"
"ori aladaaṣe ti <i>tpm2-tools</i> kuna. Ṣiṣe <code>sudo apt fi sori ẹr"
"ọ tpm2-tools</code>. Ja bo pada si sọfitiwia orisun caching."

#: src/onboarding.py:482
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi {} rẹ nipa lilo ijẹrisi oju (apamọwọ ti "
"a rii: {}).\n\n<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Ko si ohun elo TPM ti a rii. Lilo cachi"
"ng ijẹrisi orisun software (AES-256-GCM)."

