msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Ṣii silẹ laifọwọyi"

#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Mu ijẹrisi oju ṣiṣẹ lati ṣii bọtini iwọle rẹ laifọwọyi tabi KWallet ni"
" wiwole. Eyi tọju ọrọ igbaniwọle rẹ ni aabo ni aabo ni TPM nigba ti o "
"wa, tabi ti paroko pẹlu AES-256-GCM nipa lilo bọtini titunto-root nika"
"n. Awọn iṣeto auth oju PAM_AUTHTOK fun pam_gnome_keyring tabi pam_kwal"
"let5 da lori tabili tabili rẹ."

