"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello yoo wa ẹrọ rẹ laifọwọyi fun eyikeyi awọn kamẹra ti o wa, "
"nitorinaa rii daju pe kamera wẹẹbu rẹ ti sopọ. Lẹhin wiwa atokọ ti awọ"
"n kamera wẹẹbu nkan elo yoo han. Yan eyi ti o fẹ lati lo ki o tẹ Itele"
"."

#: src/onboarding.glade:697
